Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:04.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.29,0:00:06.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我回來了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.25,0:00:08.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始先生 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.63,0:00:09.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,歡迎回來！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.01,0:00:11.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我買了伴手禮回來了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.63,0:00:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝 是什麼呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:24.14,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.90,0:00:28.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是鯱鉾行者呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:30.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我記得是雅那戈那邊的…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:33.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂得真多呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:34.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哪裡哪裡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:37.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是做些學術研究的工作…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.37,0:00:39.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這傢伙是莉露打倒的說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可真厲害！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:45.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,兩位都是身手了得的冒險者呢！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:49.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就是這樣沒錯！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:54.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此 那麼…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:56.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個… 其實我\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:59.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,正在蒐集怪物的資料\n
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以的話 能不能一起進地下城\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:04.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請你們擔任我的護衛呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:32.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（第7話 莉露與可可）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天就麻煩各位了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:48.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請多指教…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.08,0:02:50.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子也要去嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:52.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.38,0:02:54.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我明明叫她待著別來…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.47,0:02:59.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎樣？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.55,0:03:01.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,小孩子進地下城很危險喔？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:03.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你自己也是小孩吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:06.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,再說冒險者這種人大多都很隨便\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,萬一你們偷懶敷衍\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:09.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸又不可能去兇你們啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:13.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可 你這也太失禮了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.98,0:03:16.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始一定會好好工作的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.57,0:03:18.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那可難說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,明明始那麼厲害…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.21,0:03:32.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是討厭的女孩子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:35.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,最好踩到陷阱吃點苦頭！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:40.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（陷阱）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:54.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那邊有陷阱 很危險的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.23,0:03:59.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是能感知陷阱的眼鏡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.20,0:04:05.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,淺層的陷阱我都看得穿\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:10.45,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不用你多管閒事啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.00,0:04:14.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過嘛…\n我就把對你的信任度上升一點好了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:27.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,和原本的情報相比沒有差別… 是嗎\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:31.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,連這種到處都有的怪物也要紀錄啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:34.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,地下城的事\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:37.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,去問公會的大姐姐不就知道了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:40.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼還要重新調查？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:42.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,問得好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.94,0:04:44.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所謂地下城啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:47.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,到現在還是充滿謎團\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:51.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有時候會突然改變出現的怪物種類\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:52.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也可能明明是同一種怪物\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.00,0:04:54.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大小卻不一樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:58.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,給冒險者添麻煩的變化可多了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過 也有能提前看出變化的例子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:04.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你有沒有看過史萊姆\n在房間角落抖個不停\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.01,0:05:07.26,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,然後就不動了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:12.06,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:14.39,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果看到了 先別打倒它\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.48,0:05:16.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,隔天再去看看？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.23,0:05:20.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,應該會出現眼珠變成寶石的史萊姆喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.61,0:05:23.03,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼！寶石史萊姆！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.11,0:05:24.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:28.37,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,當然是真的 也正因為要察覺這種徵兆\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.49,0:05:31.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才更該定期觀察才行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:36.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼 你連這種事都不知道？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:39.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這可是很有名的案例耶？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:43.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才說冒險者就是笨啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.71,0:05:45.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,另外還有幾個例子喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.39,0:05:52.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 一不小心說漏嘴了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,少裝了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,“說漏嘴了”不是那個意思！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.35,0:05:58.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀哎呀\n
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.31,0:06:01.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在地下城裡請不要大聲喧嘩喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:05.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在地下城吵架做什麼 笨蛋們！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要稍微休息一下嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.86,0:06:44.98,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:51.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在畫畫？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畫得很爛我就笑你！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.37,0:06:59.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幹嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.75,0:07:01.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒… 沒事！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:03.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你做這行很久了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.54,0:07:07.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒有啦 平常也就是幫忙農務\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:12.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,存到一點錢之後\n才像這樣做點學術工作…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:14.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,如果這些資料賣得出去\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:17.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就能讓家人過得輕鬆些…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:21.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟一直讓妻子和女兒為我操心了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:24.90,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以看看嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.15,0:07:26.44,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,請請請\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:29.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是希望能讓冒險者派上用場嘛！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:39.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這也太厲害了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:41.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有這麼多情報\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冒險者就能安心多了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:46.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真想找機會看看那份資料\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:50.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我覺得公會也一定用得上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:54.80,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 話說回來 東雲先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:57.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前不是去過嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:07:59.31,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,雅那戈那邊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.11,0:08:07.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,委託書堆得不少啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.44,0:08:09.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟累積了五天…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:12.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你們給了我這麼棒的成果\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:14.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很過意不去…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.78,0:08:17.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:20.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,行啦 就照老樣子隨便做做\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:23.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就拜託你們了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:24.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:30.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 爸爸在工作嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:33.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我想把飯送去房間給他…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.05,0:08:36.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,沒問題喔 你稍等一下\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.76,0:08:39.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過真的很厲害耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:42.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你爸爸是學者對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:43.94,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好帥喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.56,0:08:47.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不… 沒有啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:48.19,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,啥？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.40,0:08:49.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,學者？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.48,0:08:53.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙 是雞獸人吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:56.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那你老爸也不就是笨蛋嗎！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,畢竟“雞腦袋”就那程度啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋還敢自稱學者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼爛笑話啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.17,0:09:14.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.38,0:09:17.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你明明都認識爸爸…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:20.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸才不是笨蛋！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨的是你們這些冒險者啦…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:30.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天真是氣死人的一天！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.90,0:09:33.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個雞腦袋 明明自己一個人\n不敢進地下城還那麼跩！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:35.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,還一副了不起的樣子！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是個讓人火大的臭小鬼啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個叫可可的傢伙！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:44.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也一樣是小鬼吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢瞧不起莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.37,0:09:48.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,超級討厭的！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:51.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過那個大叔很聰明又很厲害\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.38,0:09:53.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,但那個孩子就不行的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:55.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那傢伙只是因為爸爸很聰明\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:58.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就得意忘形了！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,肚子餓了啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你有在聽嗎？ 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:03.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有在聽啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本沒在聽的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露明明氣成這樣\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要好好聽啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:18.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 今天你\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:19.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我把資料給公會那邊看了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,結果 他們願意收購！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且還說只要品質一致\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:30.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,之後也願意持續購買…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:33.25,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真的非常感謝！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:35.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那太好了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:37.55,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,接下來可要忙起來囉！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,所以說嘛…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.68,0:10:44.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我會在這個村子待一陣子\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:47.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,跟… 跟你們好好相處也不是不行啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你那什麼表情啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:54.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有話想說就給我說清楚！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.86,0:10:57.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望你消失\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.57,0:10:58.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:02.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能好好講話！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.99,0:11:08.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（29歲單身中堅冒險家的日常）\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:12.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼莉露要留守啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:15.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,始 給我重新想清楚！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我很忙啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.47,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-莉露 大叔村裡的工作\n-那跟我沒關係的說\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-好像有一堆要做…\n-為什麼你要說那種話\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:27.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,忙的話就需要莉露吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也太會辯了吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:33.81,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露絕對派得上用場啦 始！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,帶我去！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,史萊姆在天上飛耶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:41.36,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:42.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那混帳！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:44.87,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,連莉露都還沒飛過的說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:47.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪裡？ 始\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:52.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,什…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.54,0:11:55.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的把莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,丟下不管了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:01.72,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天也沒辦法啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:02.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,等等我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:05.60,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,冷靜點啦 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:10.27,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,放開我！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,-我就叫你冷靜！\n-別阻止我啦 安揚戈！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.19,0:12:16.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那邊的銅等級冒險者們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天能不能請你們\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,幫我工作呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.95,0:12:25.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要給莉露我們工作？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:26.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你眼光真好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:38.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,屠龍？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.46,0:12:41.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上面寫的是採礦啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:45.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你識字啊！安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.22,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 委託牌的張貼\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就麻煩安揚戈了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:54.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那莉露呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:56.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露要做什麼才好？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:58.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,麻煩你打掃地板\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:08.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就交給我吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.66,0:13:11.16,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我會把地板擦得亮晶晶！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:19.54,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,麻煩張貼“山狼討伐”的委託牌\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:20.71,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.63,0:13:22.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我看看…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:38.77,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,把這一列和這一列的數字加起來\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:40.52,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,照順序寫上去就好\n
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.98,0:13:41.82,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:10.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要放到入口那邊來著嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.06,0:14:15.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.57,0:14:24.73,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 你沒事吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:33.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:35.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露什麼忙都幫不上\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:40.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼啊？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.46,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是很努力在打掃嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:45.42,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那種工作誰都做得到吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:47.51,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:51.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露不識字\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:55.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,力氣也小 是不合格的冒險者…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:58.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,有這麼沒用的同伴\n
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:00.85,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:06.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,別說那種話啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.16,0:15:14.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.91,0:15:20.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,原來如此\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,確實 今天的莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:24.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,做的都是誰都能做的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:29.63,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不過 看著這樣的莉露\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.13,0:15:32.30,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我反而覺得“不愧是東雲先生的夥伴”\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:34.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,很佩服呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在村子裡接的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,常常會請人處理\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,期限快到卻沒人接的委託\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.61,0:15:45.07,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那種委託通常\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,針對內容而言報酬偏少\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:50.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且多半麻煩又無聊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:54.91,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 如果因為覺得無聊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:56.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,就隨便應付\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.37,0:15:58.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至會牽涉到村子的存亡\n
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.33,0:16:01.62,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對工作保持真誠 認真\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:05.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這才是“駐村冒險者”最重要的條件\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:07.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,而且那也是\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:10.17,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生和莉露所擁有的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:12.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,作為冒險者非常強大的武器！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,總算弄完了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.94,0:16:32.28,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:44.79,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我請她們兩個幫忙公會的工作\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:48.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露非常認真地把打掃做完了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:50.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,東雲先生\n
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.51,0:16:54.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我有點在意一件事…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.74,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,讀寫啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:26.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,反正今天也休假\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:27.33,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,剛好吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:35.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是莉露嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.89,0:17:39.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露也來上學啦？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:40.76,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,上學？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.01,0:17:43.48,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你是來讀書的吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,能跟莉露一起我超開心的啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.77,0:17:51.32,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,玩得開心點\n
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:53.40,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:07.50,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這位是莉露 還有可可\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.29,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大家要好好相處喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:10.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:15.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼那傢伙會在這裡！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:18.59,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那 莉露想學什麼呢？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:37.99,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 很不擅長文字…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:39.78,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:41.70,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那就學讀寫吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.41,0:18:44.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可 你會讀寫對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.33,0:18:46.58,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以幫忙教莉露嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.66,0:18:48.08,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可以嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.09,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.42,0:18:56.13,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要我教是可以啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你要感謝我喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我會教到連你這個笨蛋\n
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.13,0:19:00.89,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也聽得懂為止\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:09.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,要認真學喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:12.56,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,既然是冒險者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.65,0:19:15.15,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,在地下城打怪不就好了？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:16.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那樣不行\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.57,0:19:20.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露想要能讀懂委託書\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.49,0:19:23.95,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也想能查怪物的資料\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.49,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:27.41,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,想變得像始那樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:34.92,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.34,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣也好啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:41.68,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我也夢想成為像爸爸那樣的學者\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.68,0:19:48.35,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,怎樣 不行嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.89,0:19:51.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,夢想… 原來如此…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.06,0:19:57.11,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露的夢想是成為超強的冒險者的說！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.16,0:20:08.66,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的！你那樣握筆怎麼可能寫得漂亮啦\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.21,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,用手指夾住…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:13.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,對 就是這樣…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.38,0:20:22.18,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,學得怎樣啊 莉露？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:23.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,安揚戈！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.01,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那個… 你是莉露的新朋友對吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.51,0:20:29.43,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我是安揚戈 請多指教\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:33.65,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,才… 才不是朋友咧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.20,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,莉露 來玩躲避球吧！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:45.57,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊好啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.04,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,一起玩吧？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.71,0:20:52.75,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,不了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:55.67,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,我還想再看一下書\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:57.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:59.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.38,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:03.97,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,好 讓你們久等了\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.05,0:21:04.93,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,快點快點\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.22,0:21:07.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,今天的莉露可不一樣喔\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:17.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這是 大鍬形蜻蜓！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:19.86,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,超帥的\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.15,0:21:22.69,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,是我那個城鎮沒見過的品種！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:24.61,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,也算我一份啦！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:26.53,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,你也要玩啊！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:28.24,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,書不看了嗎？\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.83,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,那是可可…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.83,0:21:35.96,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,她居然在跟朋友玩！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.33,0:21:38.00,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,看招！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:42.88,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,丟給莉露！丟給莉露！\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:46.84,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,他們感情還很好呢\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:48.05,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,做得不錯嘛\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:52.64,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,大自然又漂亮 生物也豐富\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:56.10,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,可可看起來有精神多了…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:01.23,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,這真是個好村子啊…\n
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.04,0:23:40.12,Font1OutlineShadow,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（下回 村子的一員）\n
